# Execute Step 0 and Step 0.3 — the full PLAN text (on-demand reference)

Read by the execute command from the project root when its Step 0 routing sends it to the full
PLAN text: the full lane, an untrusted light lane, loop mode, or an oversize light task. The command
keeps the Step 0 and Step 0.3 headings, Step 0's head and the light block.

Where this file says "above" or "below" or names a step it does not contain, it refers to the
`/hm:execute` command this was read from, not to this file.

